    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I used an online math tutor app for quadratic equations during my exams last semester. It adapted explanations based on where I struggled, like breaking down formulas into interactive steps. While it wasn’t perfect—sometimes it oversimplified—I found it helpful for catching mistakes and reinforcing key ideas. It made me feel less alone in the process, especially with structured feedback.",
